[h1]Boss Physics[/h1]
[b]Walls stop boss attacks, and bosses break walls.[/b]
Hiding behind a wall now protects you, but only for a while.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Walls block direct fire[/b]: whitelisted boss projectiles (Evils Protector's bolts, Crystal Dragon's shards, ...) stop at the first wall instead of flying through it. Lobbed attacks (spider spit, eggs, boulders) still arc over walls.
[*][b]Projectiles damage walls[/b]: every hit chips away at the wall until it breaks. Broken walls drop their item as usual.
[*][b]Explosions break walls[/b]: Swamp Guardian's boulders blast objects around where they land.
[*][b]Summons dig in[/b]: portal minions, spider hatchlings and crystal golems that cannot reach you walk around half cover, break the door of a closed room, and break a wall only when there is no door.
[*][b]Tool tiers[/b]: each boss can only break walls up to its tier. Early bosses break wood, stone, brick and dungeon walls; Swamp Guardian also deep stone; Crystal Dragon also obsidian.
[*][b]Safe places stay safe[/b]: no wall damage inside settlements by default; protected tiles (boss arenas, dungeons) and unbreakable objects are never damaged.
[/list]

[h2]Settings[/h2]
Edit [i]cfg/mods/a632079.bossphysics.cfg[/i] (every key is commented) and run [b]/bp reload[/b]. In multiplayer the server's settings apply to everyone and are sent to clients automatically.
[list]
[*]Toggle each mechanic, wall damage multipliers, damage inside settlements
[*]Tool tier per boss
[*]Which projectiles, explosions and summons are affected
[/list]

[h2]Commands (admin)[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]/bp status[/b]: show the settings in force
[*][b]/bp reload[/b]: reload the settings file
[*][b]/bp debug, /bp spawnboss, /bp autotest[/b]: testing tools
[/list]

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Every player needs the mod: clients simulate projectiles too.
[*]Lasers, charges and ground AoE attacks still go through walls.
[*]Every default entry passed an automated balance test (open field, closed box, half cover, box with a door).
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Boss Physics 物理化 Boss[/h1]
[b]墙能挡住 boss 的攻击，boss 也能把墙打穿。[/b]
躲在墙后能保护你，但撑不了太久。

[h2]功能[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]墙挡直射[/b]：列入白名单的 boss 弹体（Evils Protector 的弹幕、Crystal Dragon 的碎片等）撞墙即停，不再穿墙。抛物线类攻击（蜘蛛吐液、蛋、巨石）照样飞过墙。
[*][b]弹体拆墙[/b]：每次命中都会削减墙的耐久，直到打穿。被拆的墙照常掉落物品。
[*][b]爆炸拆墙[/b]：Swamp Guardian 的巨石落地时会炸毁周围的物体。
[*][b]召唤物破墙[/b]：传送门小怪、蜘蛛幼崽、水晶傀儡够不到你时，有路就绕过半掩体；被围住时先破门，没有门才拆墙。
[*][b]工具等级[/b]：每个 boss 只能打坏不超过自己等级的墙。前期 boss 能拆木、石、砖墙和地牢墙；Swamp Guardian 还能拆深石墙；Crystal Dragon 还能拆黑曜石墙。
[*][b]安全区域不受影响[/b]：定居点内默认不拆墙；受保护的地块（boss 场地、地牢）和不可破坏的物体始终打不坏。
[/list]

[h2]设置[/h2]
编辑 [i]cfg/mods/a632079.bossphysics.cfg[/i]（每项都有注释），然后输入 [b]/bp reload[/b]。联机时以服务器的设置为准，会自动发给所有客户端。
[list]
[*]分别开关每种机制，调整墙体伤害倍率，定居点内是否拆墙
[*]每个 boss 的工具等级
[*]受影响的弹体、爆炸和召唤物
[/list]

[h2]指令（管理员）[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]/bp status[/b]：显示当前生效的设置
[*][b]/bp reload[/b]：重新读取设置文件
[*][b]/bp debug、/bp spawnboss、/bp autotest[/b]：测试工具
[/list]

[h2]说明[/h2]
[list]
[*]所有玩家都需要安装：客户端也要模拟弹体。
[*]激光、冲锋、地面范围攻击仍然穿墙。
[*]所有默认条目都通过了自动化平衡性测试（空地、全封闭、半掩体、带门的封闭房间）。
[/list]
